<title>USA: LeCenter ISD 392, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>LeCenter ISD 392, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $7.200 million of LeCenter ISD 392, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.3611 percent.</p>
</text>
